[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4503991609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119342#issuecomment-4503991609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119342","id":4503991609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDHV1OQ","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-21T01:31:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T01:31:13Z","body":"I'd have to find some time to test this a bit more but it seems like a good bit of checking to add. I definitely know that I've made mistakes around this in the past and with certain GPU drivers being very forgiving bugs often go unnoticed until they run on certain hardware. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4503991609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744918529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119342#issuecomment-4744918529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119342","id":4744918529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGtG2AQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T18:20:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T18:20:08Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4744918529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4749472721","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119342#issuecomment-4749472721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119342","id":4749472721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGxcz0Q","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T07:35:48Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T07:36:34Z","body":"@blueskythlikesclouds this introduced a regression for the mobile renderer that results in a black screen for 3D content.\r\n\r\nThe issue is 3D content uses subpasses, and this function does not handle the `SpvDimSubpassData` variant:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d9ea5c261eb69110e03aafb6b6705bca762fca8d/servers/rendering/rendering_shader_container.cpp#L142-L157\r\n\r\nThe believe the fix is pretty straightforward (which works for me):\r\n\r\n```diff\r\nSubject: [PATCH] renderer: handle subpass data for mobile renderer\r\n---\r\nIndex: servers/rendering/rendering_shader_container.cpp\r\nIDEA additional info:\r\nSubsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP\r\n<+>UTF-8\r\n===================================================================\r\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/rendering_shader_container.cpp b/servers/rendering/rendering_shader_container.cpp\r\n--- a/servers/rendering/rendering_shader_container.cpp\t(revision 4369d1fe6f67c3e070f546295baa9a11c8160821)\r\n+++ b/servers/rendering/rendering_shader_container.cpp\t(date 1781842795378)\r\n@@ -149,6 +149,8 @@\r\n \t\t\treturn RenderingDeviceCommons::TEXTURE_TYPE_3D;\r\n \t\tcase SpvDimCube:\r\n \t\t\treturn p_arrayed ? RenderingDeviceCommons::TEXTURE_TYPE_CUBE_ARRAY : RenderingDeviceCommons::TEXTURE_TYPE_CUBE;\r\n+\t\tcase SpvDimSubpassData:\r\n+\t\t\treturn RenderingDeviceCommons::TEXTURE_TYPE_2D;\r\n \t\tdefault:\r\n \t\t\treturn RenderingDeviceCommons::TEXTURE_TYPE_MAX;\r\n \t}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4749472721/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]